        "heading": "How To Get More Leads as a Tradie",
        "sub_heading": "Professional Branding & Smart Email Marketing",
        "text": "<p>Book yourself out so you’re never stressing about chasing new jobs or following up with old clients. With automated email marketing, you can nurture leads, bring in new customers, and stay top of mind with past clients—all without lifting a finger.</p><p>A professional website, targeted ads, and a solid email strategy give you a multi-channel system to keep leads rolling in.</p><p>We’ll help you climb Google search results with SEO, run retargeted ads for interested customers, and get previous clients to leave online reviews—so you stand out and win more jobs.</p>",
